( hardware test program for the burn-in machine: X only, +-300 mm, )
( full speed 500 mm/s both ways, feeds, reversals; about 15 s.    )
G21 G90 G17 G64
G0 X0
( rapids at full speed, both directions )
G0 X300
G0 X-300
G0 X0
( feeds )
G1 X20 F600
G1 X-20 F3000
G1 X100 F12000
G1 X-100 F30000
G1 X0 F30000
( short reversals )
o100 repeat [10]
  G1 X5 F12000
  G1 X0
o100 endrepeat
( small steps, then rest )
o110 repeat [5]
  G1 X0.05 F300
  G1 X0
o110 endrepeat
G4 P0.5
M2
